#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:721
msgid "no page caching plugin found — only the core purge signal will be sent"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:742
msgid ""
"A page cache serves the totals that were current when it stored the page — "
"often for hours. These patterns decide how hard the plugin works to correct "
"that: by refreshing figures in the visitor's browser, and by telling the "
"cache to rebuild when a donation lands."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:763
msgid "Custom settings"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:768
msgid "Refresh figures"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:773 includes/admin/class-settings.php:812
msgid "Never"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:774
msgid "On page load"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:775
msgid "On load and when the tab regains focus"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:776
msgid "Continuously, on a timer"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:790
msgid ""
"Fetches current figures over a route no page cache touches, then patches "
"them into the page. This is what makes cached HTML harmless."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:795
msgid "Timer interval"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:800 includes/admin/class-settings.php:839
msgid "seconds"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:802
msgid ""
"Only used by the timer mode. Every open tab makes one request per interval, "
"so short values cost real server time under heavy traffic."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:807
msgid "Purge on donation"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:813
msgid "Pages that show the campaign"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:814
msgid "Only the URLs listed below"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:815
msgid "The entire site cache"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:829
msgid ""
"The plugin records which pages display which campaign as they render, so it "
"can rebuild exactly those and leave the rest of the site cached."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:834
msgid "Minimum time between purges"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:841
msgid ""
"Stops a burst of donations from emptying the cache continuously, which would "
"leave every visitor waiting for a full render."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:846
msgid "Always purge these URLs"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:852
msgid ""
"One per line. A path such as /campaign/ is resolved against the site "
"address, so the list survives a domain change."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:857
msgid "WCDP cache lifetime"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:862
msgid "seconds (0 keeps WCDP's own six hours)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:864
msgid ""
"Applies to the donation counter and the leaderboard. The raised total is not "
"affected: WCDP already drops it within about thirty seconds of a donation, "
"through WooCommerce Analytics."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:869
msgid "Force recalculation"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:875
msgid "Drop WCDP's stored total on every donation"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:878
msgid ""
"Only needed where WooCommerce Analytics is disabled or lagging. It costs one "
"heavy database join on the next uncached render."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:886
msgid "Donation form script"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:889
msgid ""
"WCDP renders the form hidden and reveals it with its own script. Every "
"\"delay JavaScript until interaction\" feature holds that script back, so "
"the form waits behind a spinner until the visitor moves the mouse — which on "
"a phone may never happen."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: optimisation plugin name.
#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:904
#, php-format
msgid "%s (needs \"Also mark the tags\")"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:915
msgid "Protection"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:918
msgid "Donation form script protection"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:925
msgid "Only where the form is (recommended)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:926
msgid ""
"Tells WP Rocket, LiteSpeed, Perfmatters and Autoptimize to leave the form "
"script — and jQuery, which it needs — alone, but only on pages that actually "
"contain a form. The rest of the site keeps every optimisation."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:929
msgid "Also mark the tags (widest coverage)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:930
msgid ""
"Adds opt-out attributes the above plus Cloudflare Rocket Loader, WP Meteor "
"and NitroPack understand. These cannot be limited to form pages, so jQuery "
"stops being delayed site-wide. Use it if the form still shows a spinner."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:933
msgid "Off"
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:934
msgid ""
"Change nothing. Only sensible if you maintain the exclusions by hand in your "
"caching plugin."
msgstr ""

#: includes/admin/class-settings.php:956
msgid ""
"With this on, remove any manual exclusion you added for the donation form or "
"jQuery in your caching plugin — a manual jQuery exclusion applies to the "
"whole site and undoes the point of the targeted mode."
msgstr ""

#: includes/cache/class-freshness.php:98
msgid "Live campaign"
msgstr ""

#: includes/cache/class-freshness.php:99
msgid ""
"Figures refresh every 30 seconds while the tab is open, and caches are "
"purged the moment a donation lands. Use it while a fundraiser is under paid "
"traffic."
msgstr ""

#: includes/cache/class-freshness.php:102
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr ""

#: includes/cache/class-freshness.php:103
msgid ""
"Figures refresh when the page loads and when the visitor returns to the tab. "
"One small request per page view. The right choice for almost every site."
msgstr ""

#: includes/cache/class-freshness.php:106
msgid "Maximum speed"
msgstr ""

#: includes/cache/class-freshness.php:107
msgid ""
"No JavaScript and no requests. Freshness relies on cache purging alone, so a "
"visitor holding a page open — or one served from their browser cache — keeps "
"the old number."
msgstr ""

#: includes/cache/class-freshness.php:110
msgid "Custom"
msgstr ""

#: includes/cache/class-freshness.php:111
msgid "Every knob exposed individually."
msgstr ""

